{"ts":"2026-08-31T16:25:42.730Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"2f46f42141870013feb8f1ab","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T16:25:42.730Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-31T16:25:42.730Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Convergence applied. Root pin bumped from 2026.8.21 to 2026.8.31 (exact). history-repair --all recomputed the ops-w3ke stream (7 entries rehashed, 0 patched, no item reconciliation). Pre-repair health reported history_drift_chain_mismatch:ops-w3ke (gate_failing) and a stale extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew (local self-extension still pinned to 2026.8.21). Reinstalled the pm-ops self-extension against the new binary so the host-version census agrees. Post-repair pm health --strict-exit exits 0. git status shows only .agents/pm/history/ops-w3ke.jsonl, package.json, package-lock.json changed; all .toon payloads byte-identical. The history-repair warnings (history_repair_discarded_authors / reconcile_discards_events) are the known false alarms from pm-cli#1168 — nothing was discarded."}]}],"before_hash":"e844d4368da188b5a1256745fb019175eae8ab3447503db17eae7120c990baae","after_hash":"196bac4d6a1d0e21ee7d8b8b632c3329c69bb0f06031b345777f64c5ac5aafb4","item_hash_version":3}
